messages.content:
THOUGHT: The bug is in script.js. It increments `count` by 2 each click and then displays `count - 1`, so after N clicks it shows 2N-1 instead of N. The fix is simple: increment by 1 and display `count` directly. I'll rewrite script.js accordingly.

```mswea_bash_command
cat > /home/user/app/script.js <<'EOF'
let count = 0;

document.getElementById("increment").addEventListener("click", function () {
  count += 1;
  document.getElementById("count").textContent = String(count);
});
EOF
```

